{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46248","headline":"别卢使君归东阳二首 一 · 贯休","name":"别卢使君归东阳二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨气蒙蒙草满庭，式微吟剧更谁听。\n诗逢匠化唯贪住，日觉恩深不易铭。\n心苦祗应消鬓黑，梦游频入倚天青。\n从兹还似归回首，唯祝台星与福星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}